        "procedure": "Methyl salicylate (0.41 g, 2.7 mmol) was dissolved in methanol, and triethylamine (0.44 g, 4.40 mmol) was added with stirring at 40 °C. Tb(NO3)3·6H2O (0.686 g, 1.52 mmol) in methanol was added dropwise, followed by further stirring for 20 min, affording white powder Tb9(sal-Me). Colorless block single crystals were obtained from methanol solutions.",
